lor: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    jit-siā̰-jit-siâ̰ lêh-kio’tio-li\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">目滓<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">빡새`</rt></ruby><a href=\"#_ftn1\" id=\"_ftnref1\"><strong>¹</strong></a> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">親像<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">친ˉ츌ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">雨水<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">허쥐`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">滴<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">딯</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    bak-sài chīn-chiṵ̄, hor-jùi tih\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">自從<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">주졍ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">離開<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">리퀴ˆ</rt></ruby>’꽈, <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">暗暝<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">암`미ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">變成<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">볜`솅-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">日<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">띧ˆ</rt></ruby>’시\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    ju-jióng lì li-khûi’goa, àm-mí pièn-sieng-rît’si\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    뽀<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">暝<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">미ˊ</rt></ruby> 뽀<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">日<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">띧ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">來<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">래-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">思念<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">수ˉ럄ˉ</rt></ruby>’릐\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    bo-mí bo-rît lai-sū-liām’li\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">想起<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">슐키ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">過去<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">궤`킈</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">誓言<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">세`꼔ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    siṵ-khî-kuè-khi’e sè-gién\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">如今<rt s